sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Operador
  participant ETL as Migrador
  participant S2 as S2 Catalogo/Fondos
  participant S1 as S1 Identidad
  participant S3 as S3 Postulacion
  participant S4 as S4 Becas
